# Client build uses `context: .` but its Dockerfile COPYs nothing (source comes via bind mount
# at runtime), so excluding heavy/irrelevant paths just shrinks the build context sent to the daemon.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
dist
build
**/dist
**/build
target
**/target
_build
deps
test-results
playwright-report
.browser-tests
*.png
*.log
.env
